  "title": "Highlander Robotics",
  "description": "Highlander Robotics is a student-led team founded in 2019 to create opportunities in STEM for high schoolers in the Bay Area. With the help of our experienced mentors, students learn industry-level design, engineering, and programming skills in addition to making friendships and connections across different age groups.",
  "bodyClass": "body",
  "body": "<div class=\"section\"><div class=\"div-block\"><h1 class=\"heading h1 white\">Highlander Robotics</h1></div></div><div class=\"section-2\"><div class=\"text-block body-large\">Highlander Robotics was founded in 2019 to <span class=\"highlight\">provide access to engineering</span> through competitive robotics for high school students of Piedmont, CA and nearby Bay Area communities. Our <span class=\"highlight\">student-led approach</span> is designed to empower our youth to become leaders in the growth of STEM education while advocating for <span class=\"highlight\">gender parity in tech</span>. We are role models in our community by embracing a culture of <span class=\"highlight\">excellence and innovation</span> in a <span class=\"highlight\">fun and collaborative</span> environment.</div></div><div class=\"section-5\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid grid-5\"><div id=\"w-node-_8b930b19-bf5d-a4fc-a662-db50dc10ad23-79717581\" class=\"div-block-3\"></div><div id=\"w-node-cd5cf069-f050-8a92-85e2-f565869296c9-79717581\" class=\"div-block-4\"></div><div id=\"w-node-fd3cf8a6-4411-cb32-216c-5cf9ef4bc5f0-79717581\" class=\"div-block-5\"></div><div id=\"w-node-c4267477-9a91-e3c3-8ae1-8f76c5e1d9c8-79717581\" class=\"div-block-6\"></div><div id=\"w-node-_54ebaa1f-1502-d732-7b2a-ca1e4a97d767-79717581\" class=\"div-block-7\"></div><div id=\"w-node-_21032119-fb9f-a17a-d99f-723c3088544d-79717581\" class=\"div-block-8\"></div><div id=\"w-node-ca3a658d-c8d7-6101-97a6-dae288d25af6-79717581\" class=\"div-block-9\"></div><div id=\"w-node-c09e381e-3e91-020e-1898-c6eca9d848ba-79717581\" class=\"div-block-10\"></div></div></div><div><section class=\"body-section\"><div class=\"section-child\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors largest\"><h1 class=\"heading-35\">Our Sponsors</h1><h1 class=\"heading-59\">Practice Field Sponsors</h1><img src=\"/assets/04c58155053e8fea-695efb445a5a7493ab412e3a_pge-foundation.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"368\" alt=\"\" class=\"largest-sponsor\"><div class=\"sponsors\"><img src=\"/assets/f1e539387fe0bcbe-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"319\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 78vw, (max-width: 767px) 48vw, 319px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/609bed1aae85d883-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo-p-500.png 500w, /assets/b34ade0789a90074-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo-p-800.png 800w, /assets/ae1e9011047e15b3-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/f1e539387fe0bcbe-65741787c2fce9717f06ddb2_Piedmont_Makers_logo.png 1341w\" class=\"largest-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/430707adec8d7327-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"260\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 78vw, (max-width: 767px) 48vw, 260px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/fe5a7cc98645739b-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/fe4be653ac7e126c-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/3c0ecd32ce6bc8d2-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /assets/430707adec8d7327-695efbb3c200e2ec54839324_KLA_Foundation_Logo.jpg 1200w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"sponsors\"><div class=\"text-block-33\">Alice Schultz In Memory of Bill Schultz</div><h1 class=\"heading-60\">Team Sponsors</h1></div><div class=\"sponsors\"><img src=\"/assets/0995973f7fe7441b-645845daa42c07f989d18caa_LLNS_LLC.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"145\" alt=\"\" class=\"image-56\"></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors large large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/680c8a76255e9c72-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"129\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 129px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/01c3cf49b375d977-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground-p-500.webp 500w, /assets/3db835d2ebe20dfb-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground-p-800.webp 800w, /assets/086188237990df99-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets/680c8a76255e9c72-695efc92d3e7736bafcec81c_GHF_Logo_DarkBackground.webp 1467w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/0837e8d07426c0a0-67560fb1a87b494f2bafd456_AptgarGroup__1_.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"190\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/eb58cca4c4aeebb3-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"235\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 48vw, 235px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/7862b9e606adaeda-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_-p-500.png 500w, /assets/7287ab2a72453549-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_-p-800.png 800w, /assets/b61acd66e7cd392d-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/eb58cca4c4aeebb3-696416053b41246c5af3dee5_GwilliamLOGO_transparent__002_.png 1897w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/d87e988474312bf9-695efab9a77e8d3081374624_google.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"199\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 48vw, 199px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/bb39bccc1daa4830-695efab9a77e8d3081374624_google-p-500.webp 500w, /assets/d87e988474312bf9-695efab9a77e8d3081374624_google.webp 1200w\" class=\"larger-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors large large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/578f0118af7071c5-695efe0f247066f7ed349dda_olympusprop.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"191\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/9951fbba3df0b8fb-67842f8a9fab76d9865b436a_wcp_logo__1_.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"127\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/d2ce8709e9c130d9-699b8632cc65e8e93980feae_anatomiclogo.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"236\" alt=\"\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/eec0c6a994116a38-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 116px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/7a999eb89d532c22-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/3d5b8298e351a38e-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/eec0c6a994116a38-699b8673a0cde3a57f8feba6_channels4_profile.jpg 900w\" class=\"large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/4e5545478568b4ce-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"167\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 167px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/08a1ac3b1224442a-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB-p-500.png 500w, /assets/3924b7252546490f-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB-p-800.png 800w, /assets/4e5545478568b4ce-69a4af949c4d979bb196f723_JJMT_Logo_Stacked_Red_RGB.png 1500w\" class=\"large-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors large large-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/ff1c4d0f3d39e0a6-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 47vw, 121px\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/assets/41f4aed2c52e49c2-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/52b98a7dc88c1b33-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/ff1c4d0f3d39e0a6-69e52a6cc46675a7e8c9b9fb_Screenshot_2026-04-19_at_12.17.44_PM.png 938w\" class=\"small-sponsor\"><img src=\"/assets/10d09a095dad41d2-645845daec63771f6a19fa1e_Making_Fun.png\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"192\" alt=\"\" class=\"small-sponsor\"></div><div class=\"w-layout-grid sponsors small\"></div></div></section></div><div class=\"section-6\"><div class=\"columns w-row\"><div class=\"column w-col w-col-5\"><h1 class=\"heading-3\">Meet Paddo the Frog</h1><div class=\"text-block-2\">Built from the ground up for the 2023 season, this year's robot took 8033 to the <span class=\"text-span\">FIRST</span>® World Championship in Houston.</div><a href=\"/robots/paddo\" class=\"button white w-button\">Learn More</a></div><div class=\"column-2 w-col w-col-7\"><div style=\"padding-top:56.17021276595745%\" class=\"w-embed-youtubevideo youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hk5MFO64Qcs?rel=0&amp;controls=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;mute=0&amp;start=0\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:auto\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen=\"\" title=\"2023 Highlander Robotics Robot Reveal Video | Paddo the Frog\"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div class=\"section-7\"><div><h1 class=\"heading-4\">Interested in joining?</h1><div class=\"text-block-3\">We're now accepting new members for the 2026-27 season.</div><a href=\"https://go.teamsnap.com/forms/523636/signups/new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button top-margin white w-button\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Register</a></div></div>"
